{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_048_23_5_02_048_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f6288ae638fea892635fa28079045a374bd4eff340f580504588e5d064bab08f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_23_5_02_048_23:5_02_048_23:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6356be41905b2a058c8da16f0b703d0ca37ec8ca7bfcddb814dbe31ad4302369",
      "text": "早上好，●●●●●●●●●●P酱。\n这个，是我送你的白色情人节礼物哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_23_5_02_048_23:5_02_048_23:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c94697d286730702eee4f3d264a09bd0a499c314922ead2d28c8b81e930fca78",
      "text": "好精致的圆珠笔啊！\n谢谢你，百百人先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_23_5_02_048_23:5_02_048_23:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd29451a4b3c810176d55efdaaad2fba80f1baa462f17f63dc451a0345a032e9",
      "text": "因为P酱在工作的时候，\n经常在记笔记嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_23_5_02_048_23:5_02_048_23:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:835571e53be5eb8de2dc2abd4da20c0f6ca9868e3e49e34bbef9c2351ab11771",
      "text": "我想着如果是圆珠笔的话，\n应该能派上很多用场吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_23_5_02_048_23:5_02_048_23:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c5450a830b8057ef6b03a7da9c9ad8fa0df503061b906a232a264820657da2d",
      "text": "百百人先生真的很细致地观察了我，\n才挑选的礼物呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_23_5_02_048_23:5_02_048_23:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cd15f9675d2cef21c9c25647bd969e17eabf1b42b68f0a908ca8f0ff3e59eed",
      "text": "嗯……因为想挑选能帮得上你忙的东西嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_23_5_02_048_23:5_02_048_23:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e372bd33cb6f9053b79630a15441b1d079e59af5d0651f7aabe64fdb7ff8279",
      "text": "我马上从今天开始就用上它哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_23_5_02_048_23:5_02_048_23:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed53411b62de5a5a3772a6f442e89a0605602c9d354f52f079ca0c4b707dbf6c",
      "text": "太好了。P酱在工作的时候，\n如果能带上那支笔的话我会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_23_5_02_048_23:5_02_048_23:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6fc8d80d80ee3512814f88eac6de431d0fb84d6152127c15fc77b88bf0971f7",
      "text": "啊……说起来等会儿就要开会了对吧。\n马上就能看到你用它的样子了也说不定……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_048_23_5_02_048_23:5_02_048_23:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d172fd7ba6aaada3242ce59649eb719e0bfe47bfdb8b78192b98caf02b50ccfd",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿。看着P酱，我也要加油啦。\n今天一整天，也请多关照哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
